			},
			"date": "2026-03-12T16:17:53.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> </p><p>When I worked as a band director for 16 years before this exiting computer maths career, I would keep a Happy File. On the hard days, I would pull out notes from students, parents, and colleagues about how I had made a difference to them.</p><p>I hope your Happy File overflows…and you get compensated for all of your excellent, excellent work.</p>",
